<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct non-ferrous investment up 10.1 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct non-ferrous investment up 10.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment in China's non-ferrous metals sector rose 10.1 percent to 9.6 billion yuan ($1.16 billion) in January to October, compared to the same period a year ago, the official Xinhua news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>Investment in metallurgy was 36.8 billion yuan during the period, up a year-on-year 7.7 percent, Xinhua said.</p>
<p>The chemicals sector saw a total of 46.9 billion yuan of investment, a jump of 30.9 percent from the same period last year, it said without giving further details.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
